{"error": false, "page": 4, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 4, "recordCount": 308, "data": [{"docid2": 1475510, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "图片新闻", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/tpxw/202002/t20200220_1475510.htm", "content": "\n　　2月19日，市长余红胜带领副市长林俊德以及市直有关部门负责同志到梅列贵溪洋片区，调研推进贵溪洋片区开发建设工作。梅列区政府区长张昌平、副区长冯火珠陪同。 \n　　余红胜先后深入金澜湾、康城一品等在建地产", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.02.20 11:00:00", "doctitle": "市长余红胜调研推进贵溪洋片区开发建设工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1553004, "sourcename": "梅列区政府网", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "W020200220405833498246.jpg", "appdocid": 1475510, "appfile": "W020200220405833498246.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202002/t20200220_1475510.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202002/W020200220/W020200220405833498246.jpg", "_href": "W020200220405833498246.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "_firstpic": "W020200220405833498246.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1470369, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "图片新闻", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/tpxw/202001/t20200129_1470369.htm", "content": "\n　　1月29日上午，市委书记林兴禄深入永安市北高速互通口、曹远镇留置观察点、社区一线和永安市应对疫情工作指挥部调研，详细了解防控人员配备、物资保障、值班值勤等情况，指导推进新型冠状病毒感染肺炎疫情防控工", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.01.29 22:17:00", "doctitle": "市领导调研应对疫情工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1547280, "sourcename": "三明市融媒体中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "222222.jpg", "appdocid": 1470369, "appfile": "W020200129803065270859.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202001/t20200129_1470369.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202001/W020200129/W020200129803065270859.jpg", "_href": "W020200129803065270859.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "_firstpic": "W020200129803065270859.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1470367, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "图片新闻", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/tpxw/202001/t20200129_1470367.htm", "content": "\n　　1月29日，市长余红胜到梅列区、沙县随机检查督促重点交通节点、社区（村）、定点酒店健康管理服务等疫情防控工作情况，并慰问一线工作人员。\n　　余红胜专门到梅列区、沙县确定的重点区域来明旅客定点酒店看望问", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.01.29 21:56:00", "doctitle": "市领导到梅列沙县检查疫情防控工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1547277, "sourcename": "三明市融媒体中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "W020200129793099476658.jpg", "appdocid": 1470367, "appfile": "W020200129793099476658.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202001/t20200129_1470367.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202001/W020200129/W020200129793099476658.jpg", "_href": "W020200129793099476658.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "_firstpic": "W020200129793099476658.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1463505, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "图片新闻", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/tpxw/202001/t20200108_1463505.htm", "content": "\n　　7日上午，备受全市人民瞩目的市政协十届四次会议举行第四次全体会议，圆满完成了各项议程，在市会议中心胜利闭幕。\n　　林兴禄、黄鹤麟、朱昌贤、李茂胜、许清华、曾明生、朱一勤、陈欣、蒋先东、包萍、谢家芹、", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.01.08 09:32:00", "doctitle": "市政协十届四次会议胜利闭幕", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1540039, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "6315ccee4.jpg", "appdocid": 1463505, "appfile": "W020200108357809015441.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202001/t20200108_1463505.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202001/W020200108/W020200108357809015441.jpg", "_href": "W020200108357809015441.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "_firstpic": "W020200108357809015441.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1462621, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "图片新闻", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/tpxw/202001/t20200106_1462621.htm", "content": "\n　　5日上午，三明市第十三届人民代表大会第四次会议在市会议中心隆重开幕。\n　　担任本次大会第一次全体会议的执行主席林兴禄、詹积富、张知通、王庆、廖小华、陈仪代、肖长根、刘万年在主席台前排就座。\n　　市长", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2020.01.06 09:06:00", "doctitle": "市十三届人大四次会议隆重开幕", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1539053, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "km.jpg", "appdocid": 1462621, "appfile": "W020200106328663836642.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202001/t20200106_1462621.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202001/W020200106/W020200106328663836642.jpg", "_href": "W020200106328663836642.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "_firstpic": "W020200106328663836642.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1282588, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "图片新闻", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/tpxw/201904/t20190417_1282588.htm", "content": "\n　　4月12日，全省学习贯彻习近平总书记重要指示精神暨学校体育工作推进培训班在我市举办。培训班深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于教育特别是学校体育工作的重要论述，学习贯彻全国、全省教育大会精神，全面落实教育部", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2019.04.17 09:56:00", "doctitle": "全省学习贯彻习近平总书记重要指示精神暨学校体育工作推进培训班在我市举办", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1351393, "sourcename": "三明市教育局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "201904161535406215.jpg", "appdocid": 1282588, "appfile": "W020190417358066983116.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0201904/W020190417/W020190417358066983116.jpg", "_href": "W020190417358066983116.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "_firstpic": "W020190417358066983116.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1266275, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "图片新闻", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/tpxw/201902/t20190215_1266275.htm", "content": "　　即日起至20日，在永安市体育中心将举办2019永安市“猪年”灯展活动；\n　　2月16日，在宁化县安乐镇夏坊村将举办古“游傩”活动；\n　　2月17日，明溪县时代广场，将举办“新时代·新明溪·新风采”农村文艺汇演；", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "", "docreltime": "2019.02.15 09:40:00", "doctitle": "三明市2019年元宵喜乐会活动安排表", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1332819, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "timg.jpg", "appdocid": 1266275, "appfile": "W020190215376231260278.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0201902/W020190215/W020190215376231260278.jpg", "_href": "W020190215376231260278.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "", "_firstpic": "W020190215376231260278.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 731593, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "图片新闻", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/tpxw/201707/t20170706_731593.htm", "content": "\n　　关爱未成年人 关爱祖国未来", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/cjwmcsgzzl/tpxw/201707/t20170706_731593.htm", "docreltime": "2017.07.06 09:40:00", "doctitle": "关爱未成年人 关爱祖国未来", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1301702, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/cjwmcsgzzl/tpxw/201707/t20170706_731593.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "W020161110484157911251.jpg", "appdocid": 731593, "appfile": "W020181219345178346710.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/